WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.589 --> 00:00:04.600
Marigold Tips, a synthetic project.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.174
Every save point was checked
with its own tests.

3
00:00:11.174 --> 00:00:15.000
A Claude Code turn starts.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.233
Time Machine saves the project first.

5
00:00:20.233 --> 00:00:24.848
The turn ends. Its save point
is checked in a safe copy.

6
00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:29.500
Broken. The app says since when,

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.661
and names the last version that works.

8
00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:38.500
Go back.

9
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:44.862
First, review what comes back
and what does not.

10
00:00:44.862 --> 00:00:49.300
Secret values and anything outside
the project do not come back.

11
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.306
It says so first.

12
00:00:51.306 --> 00:00:53.500
Bring it back.

13
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:58.424
It lands as a separate copy
on a new branch.

14
00:00:58.424 --> 00:01:02.500
The working version is back.

15
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:07.658
Your folder was not touched.
